      <activity id="32f93d13-a775-539d-a12b-8558c7627667" activityNameId="00a7a85a-f874-54db-a999-37f77e54cafb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Lithium hydroxide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Lithium hydroxide, at plant
The multioutput-process "lithium carbonate hydration" delivers the co-products lime and lithium hydroxide. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: c952992c-f8ed-3c23-8e24-506b6181656f
Hydration of lithium carbonate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Hydration of lithium carbonate
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c952992c-f8ed-3c23-8e24-506b6181656f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
